.TH "libnvmf_config_conn_is_dc" 9 "libnvmf_config_conn_is_dc" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_conn_is_dc \- is this connection a discovery controller?
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "bool" libnvmf_config_conn_is_dc
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_config_conn *conn "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "conn" 12
the resolved connection
.SH "RETURN"
true for a discovery controller, false for an I/O controller.
